dful rowing experience with no rhythms\u2014just you, the water, and your paddle.\n\n**Your Workout, Your Time**\n\nSet your timer to fit your day:\n\n* **3 Mins :** Quick mental reset.\n* **5 Mins :** Relaxing flow.\n* **7 Mins :** Deep immersion.\n\n**Choose Your Atmosphere**\n\nPick scenery to match your mood:\n\n* **Morning:** Fresh mist.\n* **Evening:** Peaceful sunset.\n* **Night:** Moonlit stillness.\n\n**Real Results**\n\nEngage your core and arms with real rowing. Track distance and calories in real-time. Low-impact cardio that is rewarding for your soul.\n\n**Key Features:**\n\n* **Scenic Focus:** Pure nature.\n* **Flexible Timers:** 3, 5, or 7 mins.\n* **Atmospheric Modes:** Morning, Evening, and Night.\n* **Stats:** Real-time distance and calorie tracking.\n\n**Find your flow today with Fit River XR .**\n", "short_description": "Fit River XR: Mindful VR Rowing Escape to serene rivers. A peaceful rowing experience with no forced rhythms\u2014just you and the water.\n\nFitness on Your Terms Set your timer and pick a session for your day:\n\n\u30fb3, 5, or 7 Minutes: Pick your duration.\n\u30fbAtmospheric Modes: Morning mist, Evening, or Night.\n\nReal Results Engage your core and arms with real rowing. Track distance and calories in real-time. Low impact, high reward.\n\nFind your flow with Fit River XR.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://newstory-inc.com/privacypolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "New Story Inc", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://newstory-inc.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "810139357995560"}, {"id": "726368587961803"}, {"id": "2776542286000603"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recom